    "detailed_description": "Good old 'shoot-em-all' returns, now in VR! Now in futuristic environment filled by robots, drones and flying cars!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this fast-paced game you have to shoot the running robots, who try escape your gun-point in any way: running, jumping, crawling, riding cars. Take your favourite pistol into your hand, and enjoy sophisticated animations of how robots fall from your well-aimed shots<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey game features:<br />\r\n- Super enjoyable robots death animations<br />\r\n- Futuristic city environment<br />\r\n- A lot of 'Mods' to customize your game experience in radical way",
